    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Estimate left:right ventricular systolic pressure and matched wall-thickness ratios in mammalian hearts. Ratios near six to seven in both measures support the claim; discordant or systematically different ratios refute it.";
